---
// NepaliFx Landing Page V2
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>NepaliFx | Modern Digital Agency</title>
		<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-slate-950 text-white font-sans selection:bg-red-500 selection:text-white">
		
		<main class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 relative overflow-hidden">
			
			<div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-red-600/20 rounded-full blur-[120px] -z-10"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] -z-10"></div>

			<div class="max-w-3xl text-center space-y-8">
				
				<h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tighter italic">
					NEPALI<span class="text-red-600 underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-8">FX</span>
				</h1>

				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full backdrop-blur-sm">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
					<p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70">Crafting a new digital experience</p>
				</div>

				<div class="space-y-4">
					<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-100">Our website is <br/>currently under construction.</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">
						We are building a new home for NepaliFx. We are a modern digital agency focused on visual storytelling and high-performance web solutions.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="pt-4">
					<a href="mailto:info@nepalifx.com" class="bg-white text-black px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-red-600 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
						Get in touch
					</a>
				</div>

			</div>

			<footer class="absolute bottom-8 text-slate-600 text-sm">
				&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} NepaliFx. All rights reserved.
			</footer>

		</main>

	</body>
</html>